[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4487869663","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119560#issuecomment-4487869663","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119560","id":4487869663,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC3903w","user":{"login":"ajreckof","id":66184050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTg0MDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66184050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof","html_url":"https://github.com/ajreckof","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-19T12:47:14Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T12:47:14Z","body":"I’m not convinced this is the right approach in terms of usability—not because it’s wrong, but because I don’t see any real benefit. Double-tapping suffers from the same issue as holding Escape: there’s no indication that the action is available, and it has a major drawback—double-tapping could accidentally change the selected key.\r\nIn my view, there are two ways to address this problem:\r\n- You could add a visual cue (e.g., a small Escape button with a circular progress bar that appears when you press Escape) to indicate that a long press is possible.\r\n- You could make the interface switch to the next focusable element when all keys are released.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4487869663/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4488634125","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119560#issuecomment-4488634125","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119560","id":4488634125,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC4sfDQ","user":{"login":"Goldenlion5648","id":32916571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTE2NTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32916571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648","html_url":"https://github.com/Goldenlion5648","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-19T14:13:18Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T14:13:18Z","body":"I was also making this change because oddly it seemed like the \"holding escape to leave the box\" was consistent when compiling the engine in dev mode, but the release versions had more trouble escaping the box by holding.\r\n\r\n> double-tapping could accidentally change the selected key\r\n\r\nI was using double tapping when I want to quickly get to the \"add new action\" section. As it stands now, if someone actually wanted to interact with an existing keybind (like edit the name or binds) by filtering, it is very annoying to get to the action list with how nested those controls are, requiring a mix of tab and arrow keys\r\n\r\n> You could make the interface switch to the next focusable element when all keys are released.\r\n\r\nThat might be one way forward, but people might be checking many keys like \"do I have something bound to 'a' <presses a>? Oh I do, what about 's' <presses s>\") With your suggestion, after pressing 'a' they would have to backtrack with `shift + tab`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4488634125/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4975375706","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119560#issuecomment-4975375706","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119560","id":4975375706,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKI41Wg","user":{"login":"Goldenlion5648","id":32916571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTE2NTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32916571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648","html_url":"https://github.com/Goldenlion5648","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-15T00:15:30Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T00:15:30Z","body":"Was there any update on this? I was going to make another issue that you can't get to \"Add New Action\" without the mouse, but it seems similar to the already linked https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117265. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4975375706/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]